  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Misc - Currently used for patient attribute options, some are added by openmrs core/emr-api, drugs, drug order options. Except for one added by openmrs/emr-api we should move all the others to their own classes. For drug it should just use Drug class.</p><p>Symptom - Currently used for COMMENT in registration. This would go away when we change it to visit attribute.</p><p>Abnormal/Duration - Discuss with openmrs.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://trello.com/c/wprlqqi7/19-marking-an-observation-as-abnormal-capturing-duration\">https://trello.com/c/wprlqqi7/19-marking-an-observation-as-abnormal-capturing-duration</a></p><p>Intake Set/Progress Set - Use these as classes to identify these disease specific concept sets</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/8585221"
      }
    },
    "view": {
